  "sentences": {
    "s001": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/a2c6efde7061561d64f0beb7901d6ecf55d8e4c8c5e7997d224651a06aa907f2.mp3",
      "text": "如果我早上有什么习惯，我必须要先说我下午的习惯。",
      "sha256": "778a41f82225ababce23c235705ded0720d641a83265ee35780a09b2562b2bb0",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.424,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s002": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/2821918ed8bd95e9e1b9cf02370835817fe23b4ff029321fc5af9d566033e785.mp3",
      "text": "我下午的习惯很简单：睡觉、玩手机、看电视。",
      "sha256": "4a04598b4c2b614d56d6c0bf3d9728a12f71d21781cef07ccbdabd59422350b3",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.568,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s003": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/eb236fed586e62d1090a507a26699399cbd848788ac4e6d6cf440ef7c3222124.mp3",
      "text": "我知道很多成功的人都喜欢很早起床，但这并不是我早起床的原因。",
      "sha256": "e34b100f06fbeb485ec974d4b463d13c50a2c2d6596e8e15bfd692adc8990548",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 7.488,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s004": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/53d9f6e8619121d97d510c70266cac4f031df921423c253947ba92ac9c622cd8.mp3",
      "text": "我每天早上五点半起床的原因很简单，就是我吃了午饭以后，就不能工作，不能学习，不能看书，什么事都不能做。",
      "sha256": "18fc312d0999e505d75ed5c56afb25aba489fbbf0d5c17f708e8913c6a15d978",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 11.856,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s005": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/e5012bc29fd566f31340c1c43a195ff01d63b370702fd5377c165a7d128408fa.mp3",
      "text": "我在厕所刷牙，我在厕所洗脸，我在厕所上厕所。",
      "sha256": "c1a83c95efd6641f2c22115caad869dbf1179c604f560a4d6302ea0e8cce63c6",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.544,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s006": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/e01c5af13de33a9c67f0e09daeee8c046680ed99dc4d28e35551cc04309e9593.mp3",
      "text": "现在我要烧水，泡咖啡。",
      "sha256": "025e55c159f1d9294874cc342412b2ab7cdf03f1ef16b365a5efe0cf2b5c297e",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 3.12,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s007": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/16db06e9db0bd01f3ec92cf13f3d78497dcf7ba0567cb156fee0b6583d23ca8a.mp3",
      "text": "我不用咖啡机做咖啡，因为我觉得很麻烦，所以我直接用热水泡咖啡。",
      "sha256": "6e6e78051005578e27998ff0cf21a4b7c2af21b351fa07825d3eb2dc6d1e54f6",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 6.984,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s008": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/8db362f6bdbc47b69381cad3ae36493fcfffe3fbfa95cb36daa41254943bd7f1.mp3",
      "text": "我很喜欢“水开了”这三个字，很有意思。",
      "sha256": "bd6d949ac072169ca6c9c72183a52f377323ba11575314f5b3e5eab8d73751c2",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 4.272,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s009": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/a5f81bd2cc7feb2220622947e2196dcaf41a75482d436575fcb13629a1026008.mp3",
      "text": "水开了，就是水很热很热了，一百度了。",
      "sha256": "d5b9317cba8377c89b6fce239539377ccc19cf6d5d4b4b238886e24da5cb13f3",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 4.656,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s010": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/07da6ebde65da82091e0e81550f8312b5310d023a7775cc926af32f42c2905cd.mp3",
      "text": "你看水开了的样子，像不像是很多很多花开的样子？",
      "sha256": "08bd7920bfd5766324485a608f899b88b3866d35985813221f7f693f201abf52",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.112,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s011": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/47179becc7c9c6df04e5064cf221da04c98d3f79492452c48d2251e882a4e287.mp3",
      "text": "所以我觉得这个词特别有意思。",
      "sha256": "bf0884a59591fd87b35dbe3b66752457389699a376fc0e8d7e1a98fc2cc487f8",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 3.48,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s012": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/a2e06dbb34f3baa8b970fa0a8c3cc3a0ead8d9ce7cc6202b7c9a6745c9fab048.mp3",
      "text": "早上好呀，这是我一天中最喜欢的时候。",
      "sha256": "c80853cbb58532873fb85c540861d28aaf40997cda1f677883279b3bd7efe9b2",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 4.224,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s013": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/782b4819df1c6adc90b22251a7fce73bfe8c7b4e666f7fd16a89bea6ef536103.mp3",
      "text": "坐在阳台上，一边喝咖啡，一边看书。",
      "sha256": "47b4e93c4f65d061cc3860fb545770e84c0c4afbc77fa4be3c76f7221a562c30",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 4.488,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s014": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/8c829d9d9d2fe81e13aeb7b5c00e14ea768b4369671f213cfb5655aafd843d4b.mp3",
      "text": "现在我的家外面是很多高楼，很高的楼。",
      "sha256": "f20d3de2187dc450ca082b380b824f1ab64eba91c8df440a483c579519a8eb45",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 4.584,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s015": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/6d4c862ab2d0386688201a8f9d2649a97cb07ca63fb09fc222217aa6270b5b72.mp3",
      "text": "以前我住在别的地方，我的家外是一座山，我很喜欢那个地方。",
      "sha256": "668919124d3eba7409724d7b433a25c9df5192d64ebee527f63b365468d01108",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 6.264,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s016": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/822d2e1fb4ffc3c39017b4e64b1669f3b43584ca556bf8d5ef6a515318dda3e0.mp3",
      "text": "你呢？",
      "sha256": "7d7e2bb6a591fa4deefeca1e4d10a09a10efb2170561ba78561f1bd4bfdc9f25",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 1.872,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s017": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/09f38ae482f5510e627fb059fcef396f5b373368779aea803e6841e45d33a973.mp3",
      "text": "如果你坐在阳台上，你想看到高楼，还是看到山？",
      "sha256": "a7d74b1b91153c0959d79a4e854317784a605a4f538206da340ba834029cd2a8",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.184,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s018": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/b9afcab50ff266e324a297a33ab0b1351d34907e0b9232d7d4bd2a81b3d442d1.mp3",
      "text": "这个房间是我的工作室。",
      "sha256": "1f1d841b46b8755424a1e27852dcc2a14c95a6e316d5d706811dab429742a161",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 2.904,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s019": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/c311dcabb1f99039c1ef2e1ff0351676945064bb0c06ed0256122489c7a3efdf.mp3",
      "text": "这里以前是一个卧室，你看，这里还有一个衣柜，就是放衣服的柜子。",
      "sha256": "4340b4398c5b271d7ba7188368ed8d22d00b36c2cf3b65ccda362b0ef3413146",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 6.864,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s020": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/46957eb4ed953d265ee363ad61d755398c0bc3752635549368dd0ff66ec3363c.mp3",
      "text": "但是现在呢，它是我的工作室。",
      "sha256": "4d1edb37ee20a021233a5dc78f41b3ca64a456b0beb831cfe4ebb4d0a90d4866",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 3.576,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s021": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/3f74f2ac576de6f9e99b55684c2cb2bc17b3c368d13f79690111ddda8bcf3361.mp3",
      "text": "我每天在这里工作、上课、拍视频、剪视频。",
      "sha256": "9cfc6c9ae21d35968a7e69d0bfaa6d5ea29dc1ad8e3a18ca61cee0de749122b8",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.496,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s022": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/ea1a78f26e7efe8c4167b532ca6b88747a59399ab6bdc4af3584bd0256d3707e.mp3",
      "text": "每天早上呢，是我的脑子最好的时候，所以早上我会做需要想、需要创造的工作。",
      "sha256": "4bf0aed3633853c9c2c0e6cc1a74c17d91bcfb312d1d455b11d666fec00233f4",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 8.136,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s023": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/3dff4287184d7438aea19eb6c892b0c239f3218dbed79b1019d9f11abd40f471.mp3",
      "text": "比如想一想我的视频要拍什么，比如设计我的课程。",
      "sha256": "7d4580ab527f1b009beca149b3f8048fa72a3b3ff5cf1979ea918a73dd5a6bbd",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.4,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s024": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/81e71ae2ed56c29c2d14af4f01d89d0183f14bdf8118cd624f0112c4a0794f8a.mp3",
      "text": "怎么让我的课又有用又有趣？",
      "sha256": "376fd31305f4354627a1a447fffd788f388d429c749e339e8934e2331357d65c",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 3.192,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s025": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/a8d9790175927170db260b0f6d86e2304caf459038b88496acdf24998cece004.mp3",
      "text": "嗯，换了一件衣服，现在呢是早上七点零七分，早上八点半我有一节课，所以从现在到八点半就是我的工作时间。",
      "sha256": "388aacefeba6cb7a17b0dc74efcc54d5cafec1d1efbfb4834db1058edc08a7a1",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 11.712,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s026": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/28081c1760dd1468f900c418e69efc7c28c236d8ebc3d9de8421e9d120c26850.mp3",
      "text": "今天早上我要完成这些工作。",
      "sha256": "f02d7b49444993572af5cc8d7a8450decdaaf145e4e6f950ceef3dc220831926",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 3.432,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s027": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/1db7edc31f30777afaf190448e86a1c1349aec8c48bf3a3d3365a6f156568252.mp3",
      "text": "现在我在用这个番茄工作法，就是我会工作三十五分钟，然后我会休息五分钟。",
      "sha256": "757c6b9d98123b820d28949996c68adf1413703634d15eafc11ea32ee536bd83",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 8.328,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s028": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/22658aadc067aece9a7a29a3a8061db2c1b2ddc227ec48e85dee224188370c57.mp3",
      "text": "可以站起来走一走，可以运动，或者看着外面发呆。",
      "sha256": "d6b9791ccda49f152cd988338db74f5dd56a4e58339c36330e71a32e5b1e0a21",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.28,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s029": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/abf7c932fec4eb7ed461e877bcfe316f856e2ede3705b2c382076cfa2dc0d66d.mp3",
      "text": "现在是八点二十五，还有五分钟我就要开始上课了。",
      "sha256": "b205b8f52203cb4b7241f0abea99edf0821abe94937a6a5c880f92d0c6fb971c",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 5.4,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s030": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/7fd1ae0a48c1ce512ec0063e70b6dfb7d4271f5ea9d5221e305336137cc81697.mp3",
      "text": "这是一节中高级水平的课，我的学生他们大概在HSK五、HSK六左右。",
      "sha256": "74e32d3e403c8e77e04cc372fb599c2fae079e81980ce63f1dcf1b7f69ad29ee",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 8.304,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s031": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/0e869048d15efe6c010b1725aabba941a09e474839e3eb51a69ae6b82274d1a4.mp3",
      "text": "这老板啊，然后你想让你的员工更努力一点，然后所以你会说一些你可以得到的东西，比如说你成功之后你可以得画饼。",
      "sha256": "d7481396f59269a0ee3cae48c38c7a8e73cda4795bbb76378efa6cf80e32ba14",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 11.4,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s032": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/a33c306a1490b2dff248eb276868b1c406e027b5be8de2cd46a3f5a564d5aac6.mp3",
      "text": "啊，他画的是一块饼还是一块冰？",
      "sha256": "a3344c9e9ed3372d8ead5c2f8c605fe482195557c01e69fcb690ac7870d78f51",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 3.864,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s033": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/a1f9c4a3c1ba9c1ef890182b53d084516b10ce843dc7104a0b5b6d59a119c7a0.mp3",
      "text": "饼干的饼，画饼。",
      "sha256": "a181e4a1f3924f942d085a709344d98047fe356ff91a3ad6392f41f22be14e2c",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 2.472,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s034": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/dc1201eb3d127dd5f78452e316d0123d3eb26bb64fc3572c1f1f7a5dc26eb9a8.mp3",
      "text": "下课了，我现在要马上去咖啡店工作，因为如果我在家工作，我就会想要休息。",
      "sha256": "828c74dd5277888a4125fc358dd8b5783ed68d02eae7e15e6f0d574e93b14937",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 8.184,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s035": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/9dc8f6b363b779c91c0633d433161501b34c13eb9ed9dbeea5ac67097bc19201.mp3",
      "text": "如果我休息，我今天就不能工作了，所以我要马上收拾东西，出发去咖啡店工作。",
      "sha256": "71b1a4b4a8982503ace6fa3019672106ff2b1089b782a2d3ba6ddfaf33acd316",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 8.208,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s036": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/3060c16123ec129af1bd2533afae0eb8f941e8e2c7dc183a621e163b300f13b7.mp3",
      "text": "现在是上午十点二十七，我要在这里工作到十二点半，然后我就可以休息了。",
      "sha256": "bf0dd3c795ae2f6adce2fb0a5402e94b9e1f274787d4de022bf8900213ce071c",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 7.536,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s037": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/aa49cb578717f2184e36e2067d488d7e7057114b5ad4c9163e0d81204994ef3f.mp3",
      "text": "那这就是我从早上五点到上午十二点的习惯。",
      "sha256": "3eca4e166d90436051d01d42bc19b1692a07cb19caccb0749e2088c51eaf27f8",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 4.8,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s038": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/822d2e1fb4ffc3c39017b4e64b1669f3b43584ca556bf8d5ef6a515318dda3e0.mp3",
      "text": "你呢？",
      "sha256": "7d7e2bb6a591fa4deefeca1e4d10a09a10efb2170561ba78561f1bd4bfdc9f25",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 1.872,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s039": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/1c547e214222f9ee1b5e107242e4251ec9e7ad60e3463d7eedaa9ddf47809b49.mp3",
      "text": "你的习惯和我一样不一样？",
      "sha256": "ba448d8355858ca350197744fb8a40377994d0fae21314d0669285be79d2fa02",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 2.808,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s040": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/de9ec1b67959336d12087672ec749d237e56b21937e94bd5cac2c48231dbc4b7.mp3",
      "text": "你喜欢早上把所有的事情都做完，还是喜欢慢慢的上午做一点，下午做一点，晚上再做一点？",
      "sha256": "66ec91908dc5192124abdc5ac7178f2b8da3406cd5d51eff7c41b39075872e42",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 8.904,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s041": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/7ace2a2b362ce24db885b8a752c2493d6bf75ba26e9215a16379098559a0194e.mp3",
      "text": "欢迎你在评论区跟我们分享，",
      "sha256": "ad22e96011a3d76a91cb28c17ef49ecc3d898d5086a8fdef700aaf82ba5094e6",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 3.144,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    },
    "s042": {
      "source": "/audio/shuoshuo/856bb45a879d94ae7f67bdad00f7944f685578f870f2f81891a2a2a553baf8cb.mp3",
      "text": "那我们就下个视频见吧，再见。",
      "sha256": "45a32c51d1b3a6164904cd8d9d911d541a8c8f76071c70060d7a9161eca0c965",
      "provider": "Microsoft Edge Read Aloud via edge-tts",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "generationRate": "-10%",
      "durationSeconds": 3.48,
      "synthetic": true,
      "validated": true
    }
  },
